---
description: Rules for vendor adapters
globs: src/adapters/**
alwaysApply: false
---

- This folder is the only place vendor SDKs are imported. One module per external system.
- Export small, typed functions in the app's own terms; never leak vendor types to callers.
- Report caught errors with `captureError` including context. Inject dependencies where it eases testing.
- Analytics event names live only in `analytics-events.ts`.
